WEBVTT

00:00:09,010 --> 00:00:14,930
I'm having gut aches after eating. Is this a side of food allergies?

00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:26,580
It can be typically if you have antibodies, so you talk about allergies. You're talking about

00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:34,900
that you have antibodies, IgG and IgA antibodies, to different proteins in food usually.

00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:43,460
Now, if you had an IgE antibodies to a food, that would be like peanut allergy where you could

00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:48,180
you know, you need an epiped to deal with this because you could go into, you know,

00:00:49,860 --> 00:00:56,180
bronchial constriction in this allergic type reaction. We're talking IgG and IgA antibodies to

00:00:56,180 --> 00:01:06,900
different peptides and proteins in food. If you have food allergies, will you get an instant

00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:17,300
ache in your gut after eating? Sometimes, quite honestly, usually not. So usually those reactions

00:01:17,300 --> 00:01:25,220
take hours to even a day for you to have. So it is kind of difficult to identify food allergies simply

00:01:25,380 --> 00:01:32,660
by your symptoms because the gut pain that you might be getting could be what you ate last

00:01:32,660 --> 00:01:39,540
night. Well, no, I'm having gut pain right after I eat. Well, there's other reasons why you'd have

00:01:39,540 --> 00:01:45,380
gut pain right after you eat. That is nothing to do with having antibodies against that food. Most

00:01:45,380 --> 00:01:50,980
common reason for having gut pain after eating is the deficiency in hydrochloric acid. Second,

00:01:50,980 --> 00:01:59,860
most common reason would go right along with that is that they have insufficiency of digestive enzymes

00:01:59,860 --> 00:02:07,140
for the patients. So that's why I suggest everybody take HCl and digestive enzymes with their meal

00:02:08,260 --> 00:02:13,780
because this is a common symptom that people get. They have, they feel bloated after they eat,

00:02:13,780 --> 00:02:19,460
they get gut pain after they eat, they feel like they have a full tummy, just eat a little bit,

00:02:19,460 --> 00:02:23,940
they get stomach ache after they eat, all these different symptoms that go along with

00:02:24,900 --> 00:02:35,300
mal digestion. So again, mal digestion is probably the double one morbidity in the world that could lead

00:02:35,300 --> 00:02:43,220
to all sorts of problems. So hypochloridria and decrease pancreatic enzyme production

00:02:44,180 --> 00:02:51,460
is the cause of that. So supporting that would be the first thing I would think. So if somebody says,

00:02:51,460 --> 00:02:56,260
I really think I should do a food allergy panel and getting gut pain after I eat my first question

00:02:56,260 --> 00:03:01,860
would be are you taking HCl and digestive enzymes? Well, no, I haven't really taken those. Well,

00:03:01,860 --> 00:03:11,860
that's what I would do first before I do a food sensitive panel.

